  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1507.02 Waiver Request Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1507.02 Waiver Request Procedures. An applicant who is or would be directly and adversely affected by the strict application of a rule in this Chapter may submit a waiver request by:\n\n(a) Providing all information required by Env-Dw 1507.03, either in writing or on form NHDES-S-03-013;\n\n(b) Signing and certifying the waiver request as required by Env-Dw 1507.04; and\n\n(c) Submitting the completed waiver request in writing to pfasrebateprogram@des.nh.gov or:\n\nNHDES PFAS Rebate Program\n\n29 Hazen Drive\n\nP.O. Box 95\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0095\n\nSource. #14201, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1500.html"
